hed\nKenya\nNyeri\nBarichu FCS Karitina Factory\nSL28/SL34/Ruiru11\nWashed\nCosta Rica\nTono Barrantes\nTypica\nBlack Honey\nCosta Rica\nTono Barrantes\nSL28\nWashed\nCosta Rica\nJuan Ramon\nGesha\nNatural\nDominican Republic\nJarabacoa\nFinca Rufino\nCaturra/Typica\nWashed\n喜欢猎奇的同学一定要来试试丸山的这批豆子，特别是这只多米尼加。",
